  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nSee https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/60466#discussion_r3402870251\n\nIn [RSA](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-media-load-algorithm) step 10\n\n> Failed with elements: [Queue a media element task](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#queue-a-media-element-task) given the [media element](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#media-element) to [fire an event](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-fire) named [error](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#event-source-error) at candidate.\n\nBut *candidate* could have been removed or moved with script. Browsers seem to not fire the `error` event in such cases, see `resource-selection-candidate-moved.html` and `resource-selection-candidate-remove-addEventListener.html` in https://wpt.fyi/results/html/semantics/embedded-content/media-elements/loading-the-media-resource?label=pr_head&max-count=1&pr=60466",
